WEBVTT

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.625
<i>Towa and Setsuna.</i>

00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:20.625
<i>Between us half-demon twins,</i>
<i>two different worlds exist at the same time.</i>

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.167
<i>Human and demon.</i>

00:00:23.458 --> 00:00:25.542
<i>Feudal era and present day.</i>

00:00:25.708 --> 00:00:27.083
<i>Peacefulness and war.</i>

00:00:27.458 --> 00:00:28.792
<i>Joy and sorrow.</i>

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.708
<i>Dreams and reality.</i>

00:00:31.042 --> 00:00:32.458
<i>One moment and eternity.</i>

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:35.458
<i>And finally, love and hate.</i>

00:00:36.458 --> 00:00:39.208
<i>A Feudal Fairytale,</i>
<i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon.</i>

00:00:39.708 --> 00:00:43.458
<i>We'll keep moving forward</i>
<i>through the hurdles of destiny!</i>

00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:57.750
I see, I see.
You look pretty tasty, monk.

00:00:58.792 --> 00:00:59.917
Master?

00:00:59.917 --> 00:01:00.958
Is it a demon?

00:01:00.958 --> 00:01:01.875
Stay back.

00:01:05.708 --> 00:01:08.167
ONE OF THE FOUR PERILS – TOTETSU

00:01:08.542 --> 00:01:09.917
Damn demon.

00:01:10.417 --> 00:01:12.167
I'll slay you!

00:01:17.875 --> 00:01:19.458
Just kidding.

00:01:21.875 --> 00:01:23.375
Master!

00:01:24.583 --> 00:01:25.583
Run!

00:01:25.792 --> 00:01:31.500
Now, I hope you taste good.
Thank you for the meal!

00:01:34.417 --> 00:01:36.083
Master!

00:01:44.292 --> 00:01:50.167
The flesh lacks depth of flavor.
I really wanted to eat that Sanzo.

00:01:52.167 --> 00:01:54.625
What do you think, Rainbow Pearl?

00:01:55.125 --> 00:02:00.667
Are there any virtuous monks
like Sanzo around here? Well?

00:02:02.917 --> 00:02:04.333
Over there, huh?

00:03:57.833 --> 00:03:59.875
"The Delicious Feudal Monks"

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:11.583
Recently, a demon has been attacking
virtuous monks and Shinto priests.

00:04:11.583 --> 00:04:13.833
Five or six have already been eaten.

00:04:13.833 --> 00:04:16.375
HALF-DEMON GIRL – TOWA HIGURASHI
DEMON SLAYER – SETSUNA
Yuck, it's eating them?

00:04:16.375 --> 00:04:17.958
A man-eating demon, huh?

00:04:17.958 --> 00:04:21.083
LEADER OF THE DEMON SLAYERS – KOHAKU
We don't know who will be targeted next,

00:04:21.083 --> 00:04:25.167
but around here, the high-ranking Buddhist priests
in the East temple are the most famous.

00:04:25.167 --> 00:04:27.083
We'll go there and protect them.

00:04:27.083 --> 00:04:31.417
MASTER OF HIRAIKOTSU – HISUI
Hisui, take these two and go to Brother's place.

00:04:31.417 --> 00:04:32.708
What?

00:04:32.708 --> 00:04:36.042
I'm sure he will be fine, but just in case.

00:04:37.083 --> 00:04:39.667
I highly doubt he would be targeted.

00:04:40.125 --> 00:04:42.833
Now, don't be like that. Let's go.

00:04:42.833 --> 00:04:43.750
Yes, sir.

00:04:45.917 --> 00:04:48.708
Whose location will we be going to?

00:04:49.333 --> 00:04:51.000
My dad's place.

00:04:51.875 --> 00:04:54.750
Hisui, your dad is a virtuous monk?

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:57.625
He's a monk, but not a virtuous one.

00:04:58.208 --> 00:04:59.625
That's harsh.

00:05:00.792 --> 00:05:05.750
My dad is a shameless person
who takes from what he can.

00:05:06.167 --> 00:05:07.958
But we're going there, right?

00:05:07.958 --> 00:05:11.542
Uncle told us to go,
so we don't really have a choice.

00:05:11.542 --> 00:05:13.750
I wonder how he's doing now.

00:05:26.542 --> 00:05:29.083
MEMORIAL TOWER

00:05:31.083 --> 00:05:32.333
Mother.

00:05:33.708 --> 00:05:36.875
HISUI'S OLDER SISTER – GYOKUTO
Do you have any messages for Father?

00:05:36.875 --> 00:05:38.750
No, not particularly.

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:41.000
Okay, then I'll be heading out.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:45.458
CAT DEMON – KIRARA

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:49.417
Hisui, your dad lives
this deep in the mountains?

00:05:49.958 --> 00:05:52.042
He's going through
one thousand–day training.

00:05:52.417 --> 00:05:58.417
A thousand? That's... two years
and 270 days. That's long.

00:05:58.875 --> 00:06:03.292
He wants to attain divine power
through one thousand–day training,

00:06:03.292 --> 00:06:05.375
but I doubt it'll go that smoothly.

00:06:05.375 --> 00:06:07.417
How many days have already passed?

00:06:07.417 --> 00:06:09.625
I think it's been over two years.

00:06:09.625 --> 00:06:10.792
Wow.

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:41.333
<i>a! a! a! un! un! un!</i>

00:06:41.333 --> 00:06:43.042
<i>a! a! a!</i>

00:06:45.792 --> 00:06:48.583
GYOKUTO &amp; HISUI'S FATHER, MONK – MIROKU

00:06:51.917 --> 00:06:53.083
Gyokuto?

00:06:55.875 --> 00:06:57.792
Hello, Father.

00:07:05.417 --> 00:07:08.292
Today will mark the 800th day.

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:09.625
Yeah.

00:07:10.208 --> 00:07:12.083
Have you gotten any stronger?

00:07:12.333 --> 00:07:13.583
I'm not sure yet.

00:07:18.333 --> 00:07:21.583
It's Hisui. I wonder who the other two are.

00:07:25.625 --> 00:07:27.375
Sister, you're here, too?

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:30.750
Just to deliver some things.
What about you?

00:07:31.208 --> 00:07:34.917
A demon has recently been attacking
virtuous monks and Shinto priests.

00:07:35.083 --> 00:07:38.625
By Uncle's orders, I've come here
with my demon slaying friends.

00:07:39.083 --> 00:07:41.458
My, you're his friends.

00:07:41.458 --> 00:07:45.625
Thank you for always taking care of Hisui.
I'm his older sister, Gyokuto.

00:07:46.792 --> 00:07:51.250
That goes for us, too.
I'm Towa, and this is my younger sister...

00:07:51.542 --> 00:07:54.542
Setsuna, you're a demon slayer?

00:07:54.917 --> 00:07:56.833
Oh, you know each other?

00:07:57.833 --> 00:07:59.500
Who are you?

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.167
You don't remember?

00:08:01.625 --> 00:08:04.542
Looking like that,
no one would know who you are.

00:08:04.875 --> 00:08:08.083
This outfit is for my training.
It can't be helped, right?

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:12.000
Well, if you don't remember,
that's another form of fate.

00:08:13.042 --> 00:08:16.375
And you're Setsuna's older sister?

00:08:16.583 --> 00:08:17.833
Yes, I am.

00:08:21.083 --> 00:08:22.667
I see.

00:08:23.375 --> 00:08:25.333
I'm going to go look around.

00:08:27.625 --> 00:08:29.792
I shall return to my training.

00:08:30.125 --> 00:08:34.375
Um, what kind of divine powers
will you attain through the training?

00:08:35.167 --> 00:08:38.667
I won't know until my
thousand days pass.

00:08:39.042 --> 00:08:42.958
Although there is a chance that
I won't attain any divine powers.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:47.625
Oh, no. So you might end up spending
a thousand days for nothing?

00:08:48.417 --> 00:08:50.792
There is no such thing as useless training.

00:08:53.792 --> 00:08:57.417
I'll be happy if my powers
become stronger even by a little bit.

00:08:57.875 --> 00:09:00.167
Do you not have confidence
in your own strength?

00:09:01.958 --> 00:09:05.792
In the past,
I had a power called the Wind Tunnel.

00:09:06.417 --> 00:09:07.833
<i>Wind Tunnel!</i>

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:16.250
Even after losing that power,
I continued to slay demons.

00:09:16.417 --> 00:09:19.500
But one day, I fought
an unbelievably powerful demon.

00:09:19.833 --> 00:09:24.208
I understood how powerless I was,
and decided to take on some training.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:25.708
<i>on!</i>

00:09:31.333 --> 00:09:32.625
Say...

00:09:33.458 --> 00:09:35.458
Would you like some tea?

00:09:41.708 --> 00:09:44.625
DEMON SLAYER – ROKUTA
DEMON SLAYER – NANASUKE

00:09:44.917 --> 00:09:46.458
That's...

00:09:48.167 --> 00:09:50.583
Moroha, what're you doing here?

00:09:51.125 --> 00:09:52.542
Being a bodyguard.

00:09:52.542 --> 00:09:53.792
A bodyguard?

00:09:53.792 --> 00:09:57.500
BOUNTY HUNTER – MOROHA
I got a job from here asking to protect their monk.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:10:00.417
I'll be getting paid
whether a demon appears or not!

00:10:00.417 --> 00:10:03.000
And if I get its head,
I get a higher bounty!

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:07.625
Wait, don't tell me you demon slayers
are after the bounty, too?

00:10:07.958 --> 00:10:11.083
Well, as our name says,
we're here to slay a demon.

00:10:11.542 --> 00:10:13.833
Chief, what should we do?

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:18.250
If Moroha says she's protecting this place,
we can move on to another.

00:10:18.625 --> 00:10:20.417
Yeah, move right on along!

00:10:20.708 --> 00:10:22.792
By the way, where are Towa and Setsuna?

00:10:23.083 --> 00:10:25.292
They're off protecting a different monk.

00:10:26.667 --> 00:10:30.500
Well, good for them, even though
the monk here is the real target.

00:10:31.417 --> 00:10:33.792
We'll head to the shrine in the South.

00:10:33.792 --> 00:10:35.125
Yes, sir.

00:10:36.208 --> 00:10:38.167
So how about it, Rainbow Pearl?

00:10:38.417 --> 00:10:41.125
Any virtuous monks at that temple?

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:44.625
Doesn't look like it.

00:10:44.833 --> 00:10:48.125
Hurry up and come over,
you man-eating demon.

00:10:48.125 --> 00:10:51.875
Come try to eat the tasty monk here!

00:11:01.917 --> 00:11:04.250
Oh, this is delicious.

00:11:06.708 --> 00:11:09.625
Does Hisui and his father not get along?

00:11:09.958 --> 00:11:12.375
There's just a small
misunderstanding between them.

00:11:12.375 --> 00:11:14.333
Hisui called him a shameless person.

00:11:14.333 --> 00:11:16.042
Oh, well that's...

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:20.625
Our father spent quite a sum
in order to provide for us, and...

00:11:21.917 --> 00:11:25.083
You could say he might've
had to push himself at times.

00:11:27.042 --> 00:11:29.500
That's right. That person is Monk Miroku.

00:11:29.958 --> 00:11:31.958
Yes, that's right.

00:11:31.958 --> 00:11:33.458
So you do know each other.

00:11:34.083 --> 00:11:36.542
His Buddhist power was indeed strong.

00:11:36.875 --> 00:11:42.125
Yes, but Hisui thinks he is a coward.

00:11:45.125 --> 00:11:47.000
Hisui!

00:11:47.792 --> 00:11:50.250
I'm going to borrow Kirara for a little bit.

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:53.500
Make sure you come home once in a while.

00:11:55.833 --> 00:11:57.167
Well, that's nice.

00:11:57.167 --> 00:11:58.542
See anything suspicious?

00:12:00.583 --> 00:12:04.375
Of course not. The man-eating demon
isn't going to come here anyway.

00:12:04.917 --> 00:12:08.542
It looks like your father has pretty
strong Buddhist power.

00:12:08.542 --> 00:12:10.500
Yes, however greedy he may be.

00:12:11.167 --> 00:12:13.417
Dad ran away from battle.

00:12:13.417 --> 00:12:16.125
He just happened to call it training.

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:19.458
But he's doing that to get stronger, right?

00:12:19.583 --> 00:12:24.375
What kind of training is it when you don't
even know if you'll attain divine power?

00:12:24.375 --> 00:12:27.875
Uncle and I are out
risking our lives slaying demons,

00:12:27.875 --> 00:12:30.208
while he's cooped up in the mountains.

00:12:30.458 --> 00:12:32.000
You don't want that?

00:12:32.292 --> 00:12:35.167
I just don't want him
to cause trouble for Mom.

00:12:36.833 --> 00:12:39.875
So it's like if Papa Sota
quit his white-collar job,

00:12:39.875 --> 00:12:42.792
and went to train at a
ramen shop for two years.

00:12:43.250 --> 00:12:45.875
And the whole family
is supporting itself?

00:12:45.875 --> 00:12:47.875
I have no clue what you're talking about.

00:12:48.125 --> 00:12:51.792
I know about Papa Sota,
but you lost me on everything else.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:55.917
What I mean is, the fathers are
doing their best, too, right?

00:12:55.917 --> 00:12:57.083
Wait.

00:12:59.333 --> 00:13:01.042
A bad smell is getting closer.

00:13:01.042 --> 00:13:02.042
What?

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:05.875
I see, I see.

00:13:05.875 --> 00:13:10.000
I sense some tasty Buddhist power.

00:13:22.875 --> 00:13:23.708
Father!

00:13:23.708 --> 00:13:24.667
Mr. Monk!

00:13:31.458 --> 00:13:32.792
So you've come.

00:13:32.792 --> 00:13:39.000
I see, I see. Not as powerful as Sanzo,
but still looks plenty delicious.

00:13:39.292 --> 00:13:43.375
Sanzo, like from "Journey to the West"?
Where are you from?

00:13:45.417 --> 00:13:47.125
Where am I from? What about you?

00:13:47.667 --> 00:13:49.875
We have no names
to give some man-eating demon.

00:13:50.083 --> 00:13:51.958
Then I won't say my name either.

00:13:53.542 --> 00:13:56.125
You're one of the Four Perils
from the Mainland, right?

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:57.792
Four Perils?

00:13:57.792 --> 00:14:02.500
That's correct. As I would expect
from a delicious-looking monk.

00:14:02.958 --> 00:14:05.250
So he's one of Kirinmaru's underlings.

00:14:05.375 --> 00:14:07.167
The fourth and last one is named Totetsu.

00:14:07.542 --> 00:14:13.167
Correct again.
But who are you guys anyways?

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:15.625
We're the ones who're going to slay you!

00:14:15.958 --> 00:14:20.375
If you're going to get in my way,
I'll just have to eat you, too.

00:14:20.875 --> 00:14:24.167
I've never eaten a half-demon before.

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:31.458
Hisui, I'll leave this place to you.

00:14:32.583 --> 00:14:36.125
Father?! Damn it,
of course he'd back out.

00:14:36.458 --> 00:14:38.250
You won't get away!

00:14:50.083 --> 00:14:52.625
Hmm, it tastes kind of spicy.

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:55.833
Then have a taste of this, too!

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:01.167
All right.

00:15:01.167 --> 00:15:02.667
What did you feed him?

00:15:02.667 --> 00:15:04.333
Habanero sauce.

00:15:04.333 --> 00:15:05.833
"Haba"-what?

00:15:05.833 --> 00:15:07.042
It's super spicy.

00:15:07.042 --> 00:15:09.667
Curse you all!

00:15:12.083 --> 00:15:13.083
Over here.

00:15:28.083 --> 00:15:29.250
Gross.

00:15:33.375 --> 00:15:35.167
Why, you!

00:15:44.625 --> 00:15:47.125
So he can suck in anything, huh?

00:15:47.458 --> 00:15:49.583
That's almost like the Wind Tunnel.

00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:51.958
Father? You didn't run away?

00:15:52.583 --> 00:15:55.333
I can't be depending on you for everything.

00:15:57.167 --> 00:15:59.417
You have demon slayer poison, right?

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:01.083
I have some right here.

00:16:03.083 --> 00:16:06.250
Get that poison to drift on to the wind
that he sucks in.

00:16:06.625 --> 00:16:07.875
Make sure it's done.

00:16:07.875 --> 00:16:09.042
Father!

00:16:11.458 --> 00:16:13.458
Scourge of Swallows!

00:16:23.458 --> 00:16:25.958
Totetsu, I'm right here.

00:16:26.333 --> 00:16:29.750
So you've decided to surrender yourself to me?

00:16:32.333 --> 00:16:33.208
Eat this.

00:16:37.083 --> 00:16:38.083
This is...

00:16:38.375 --> 00:16:40.292
It's demon slayer poison.

00:16:41.083 --> 00:16:42.250
Hiraikotsu!

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.625
Gross!

00:16:49.083 --> 00:16:51.792
Hisui, are you all right?

00:16:54.292 --> 00:16:56.375
I almost ate that poison.

00:16:56.625 --> 00:16:58.750
So he's not just some vacuum?

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:00.500
He sure didn't like the poison.

00:17:00.625 --> 00:17:03.542
How dare you all!

00:17:04.333 --> 00:17:06.333
Cyclone Burst!

00:17:08.042 --> 00:17:09.292
Now's my chance.

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:13.833
Setsuna!

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:21.083
Hang in there.

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:25.375
I accidentally inhaled some poison.

00:17:25.708 --> 00:17:26.833
Monk Miroku.

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:30.292
Please undo the seal.

00:17:30.875 --> 00:17:32.792
Setsuna? But...

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:34.583
Do you want to be eaten?

00:17:37.542 --> 00:17:39.708
No, I sure don't.

00:18:00.042 --> 00:18:01.583
I can't eat a Buddha!

00:18:07.958 --> 00:18:08.958
Release!

00:18:10.167 --> 00:18:12.792
Just get eaten already.

00:18:18.792 --> 00:18:20.792
Totetsu, I'm your opponent.

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:22.417
Setsuna? But you can't...

00:18:22.708 --> 00:18:25.583
Like a half-demon to the flame!

00:18:30.375 --> 00:18:31.542
Setsuna!

00:18:32.042 --> 00:18:34.833
What does a half-demon taste like?

00:18:37.083 --> 00:18:38.458
This is...

00:18:39.125 --> 00:18:43.708
Does my poison hand taste that delicious?

00:18:43.792 --> 00:18:45.042
What?

00:18:54.292 --> 00:18:56.958
Poisonous blood...
How could this be...

00:19:04.875 --> 00:19:05.875
What?

00:19:07.042 --> 00:19:08.333
You won't get away!

00:19:11.458 --> 00:19:15.000
I never want to eat
another half-demon ever again!

00:19:15.708 --> 00:19:17.083
Damn it, he got away.

00:19:17.875 --> 00:19:20.042
Setsuna, are you all right?

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:22.500
This is nothing.

00:19:23.125 --> 00:19:27.125
But this overflowing blood is... I can't...

00:19:27.292 --> 00:19:29.250
Setsuna, your face...

00:19:41.917 --> 00:19:43.792
Here's some water.

00:19:45.583 --> 00:19:47.125
Are you all right, Setsuna?

00:19:47.125 --> 00:19:48.042
Yes.

00:19:48.042 --> 00:19:51.875
Then, I'm going to
apply the seal again, okay?

00:19:56.167 --> 00:20:00.917
On meeting an arhat, slay the arhat;
on meeting your parents, slay your parents.

00:20:01.625 --> 00:20:05.292
Know that the light to your path lays there.

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:14.708
That should do it.

00:20:23.667 --> 00:20:25.167
Nothing's coming this way.

00:20:27.708 --> 00:20:28.917
Takechiyo?

00:20:29.875 --> 00:20:31.042
YOUNG RACCOON DOG DEMON – TAKECHIYO

00:20:31.042 --> 00:20:33.792
Hey, uh, this incident has been resolved.

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:39.625
Some demon slayers who were protecting a monk
ended up driving the man-eating demon away,

00:20:39.625 --> 00:20:41.417
so there's no more bounty.

00:20:45.542 --> 00:20:48.792
Well, Father, don't push yourself
if anything happens.

00:20:49.083 --> 00:20:51.792
Yeah, I'll run or hide if I have to.

00:20:53.125 --> 00:20:55.042
See you later.

00:21:00.375 --> 00:21:01.333
Well, then.

00:21:06.042 --> 00:21:08.042
MEMORIAL TOWER

00:21:09.958 --> 00:21:11.000
Mother.

00:21:11.625 --> 00:21:12.667
Hisui?

00:21:12.667 --> 00:21:16.958
It looks like Father will go through with
his remaining 200 days of training.

00:21:17.417 --> 00:21:18.417
I see.

00:21:21.375 --> 00:21:24.042
MIROKU'S WIFE – SANGO
I made some new protective masks.

00:21:24.042 --> 00:21:26.125
Can you take them over to Kohaku?

00:21:27.708 --> 00:21:29.792
Did something happen?

00:21:30.792 --> 00:21:32.750
Nothing, really.

00:21:39.542 --> 00:21:44.083
I was told by Monk Miroku that
the poison in my body was inherited.

00:21:44.583 --> 00:21:50.875
And if I transform into a demon,
as a half-demon, it's hard to control that power.

00:21:50.875 --> 00:21:52.042
I see.

00:21:53.125 --> 00:21:57.167
You're also a half-demon.
You might have inherited something, too.

00:21:59.292 --> 00:22:03.042
Maybe. We are sisters after all.

00:22:05.625 --> 00:22:08.542
What? Don't come near me.

00:22:08.542 --> 00:22:10.417
A little bit is fine, isn't it?

00:22:10.417 --> 00:22:11.667
Don't touch me.

00:22:11.667 --> 00:22:12.833
You're too clingy.

00:22:12.833 --> 00:22:15.583
Boo! Setsuna, you're not fair!

00:23:49.042 --> 00:23:50.042
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:50.042 --> 00:23:52.833
Isn't it strange for someone
so beautiful to be here?

00:23:52.833 --> 00:23:55.708
Tamano escaped from the clutches of
an evil mountain god.

00:23:55.708 --> 00:23:57.708
We're the only ones who can help her.

00:23:57.708 --> 00:24:00.750
But Homura looked at us with surprise.

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:05.167
I knew it was you two!
You have the Gold and Silver Pearls.

00:24:05.167 --> 00:24:07.833
To think that you were still alive...

00:24:07.833 --> 00:24:10.792
What does he mean? Does he know us?

00:24:10.792 --> 00:24:14.208
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon</i>:
"The One Behind the Forest Fire"

00:24:14.208 --> 00:24:30.059
Setsuna and I were separated because of you!
